        "description": "Converts each cell value of a raster to an integer by truncation.",
        "in_raster_or_constant.descr": "<xdoc><p>The input raster to be converted to integer.</p><p>To use a number as an input for this parameter, the cell size and extent must first be set in the environment.</p></xdoc>",
